{"seq":3,"slug":"rpki-roa-irr-origin-validation","title":"RPKI/ROA、IRR 源认证与泄露劫持防护合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/bgp-interdomain-routing-anycast-peering-edge-traffic-engineering/peering-transit-policy-rpki/rpki-roa-irr-origin-validation","wordCount":2706,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"rpki-roa-irr-源认证与泄露劫持防护合规\">RPKI/ROA、IRR 源认证与泄露劫持防护合规</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>BGP 的设计前提是&quot;每个 AS 都诚实&quot;。它从不校验一条路由声明的<strong>起源</strong>（origin）是否真的是该前缀的合法持有者——只要有人宣告 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>203.0.113.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">203.0.113.0/24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">203.0.113.0/24</span></span></span></span></span> 且 AS_PATH 最短，全网就会把去往这个地址的流量交给它。2017 年 Google 前缀被误宣告、2018 年 Amazon Route 53 的 DNS 前缀被劫持导致钱包流量被引流，这类事件不需要协议漏洞，只需要一次配置错误或恶意宣告。**源认证（origin validation）**就是补上这个缺口的一层：收到路由时，用一个由地址资源持有者签发的密码学凭证，判断&quot;这个 AS 有权起源这个前缀吗&quot;。</p>\n<p>这一层由两套并行机制组成，强度差异极大：**RPKI（Resource Public Key Infrastructure）**由五大 RIR（ARIN、RIPE NCC、APNIC、LACNIC、AFRINIC）各自运营 CA 构成层级公钥体系，持证者签出 <strong>ROA（Route Origin Authorization）</strong>，声明&quot;AS <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 有权起源前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，最长到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 位掩码&quot;（RFC 6480 架构、RFC 6482 ROA 格式、RFC 6811 起源校验）；**IRR（Internet Routing Registry）**则包括 RADb（Merit 运营）、RIPE、ARIN、APNIC、NTT 等纯文本数据库，用 RPSL 语言（RFC 2622、RFC 4012）记录 <code>route:</code> / <code>route6:</code> / <code>aut-num:</code> / <code>as-set:</code> 对象，<strong>没有签名</strong>——任何人都能对任何前缀提交对象，所以只是&quot;声明&quot;而非&quot;证明&quot;。分工是 <strong>RPKI 防伪造起源、IRR 描述策略意图</strong>，生产环境双轨并行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  HOLDER[地址/ASN 持有者] --&gt;|证书签发| CA[五大 RIR 运营的 RPKI CA]&#10;  HOLDER --&gt;|RPSL 对象提交| IRRDB[RADb / RIPE / ARIN / APNIC IRR]&#10;  CA --&gt;|rsync RFC 5781 或 RRDP RFC 8182| RP[RP 缓存校验器&lt;br/&gt;Routinator / rpki-client / FORT]&#10;  RP --&gt;|RPKI-Router 协议&lt;br/&gt;RFC 8210 TCP 323| ROUTER[边界路由器&lt;br/&gt;ROV 状态表]&#10;  IRRDB --&gt;|IRRd / bgpq4 拉取生成前缀列表| ROUTER&#10;  ROUTER --&gt;|Valid 接收&lt;br/&gt;Invalid 丢弃&lt;br/&gt;NotFound 按本地策略| FIB[转发转发表]\">flowchart TD\n  HOLDER[地址/ASN 持有者] --&gt;|证书签发| CA[五大 RIR 运营的 RPKI CA]\n  HOLDER --&gt;|RPSL 对象提交| IRRDB[RADb / RIPE / ARIN / APNIC IRR]\n  CA --&gt;|rsync RFC 5781 或 RRDP RFC 8182| RP[RP 缓存校验器&lt;br/&gt;Routinator / rpki-client / FORT]\n  RP --&gt;|RPKI-Router 协议&lt;br/&gt;RFC 8210 TCP 323| ROUTER[边界路由器&lt;br/&gt;ROV 状态表]\n  IRRDB --&gt;|IRRd / bgpq4 拉取生成前缀列表| ROUTER\n  ROUTER --&gt;|Valid 接收&lt;br/&gt;Invalid 丢弃&lt;br/&gt;NotFound 按本地策略| FIB[转发转发表]</pre><p>收到一条宣告 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(p, a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、起源 AS <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>）时，RPKI 校验器按 RFC 6811 输出三态之一：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Valid</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>ROA</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo>⊆</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Valid}(p,a) \\iff \\exists\\, r \\in \\text{ROA}:\\; p \\subseteq p_r \\;\\wedge\\; |p| \\le m_r \\;\\wedge\\; a = a_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Valid</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ROA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7056em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⊆</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\subseteq p_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|p| \\ge |p_r|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|p_r|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 位与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相同。无匹配覆盖时是 <strong>NotFound</strong>；存在覆盖但 ASN 不符或掩码超 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时是 <strong>Invalid</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校验状态</th>\n<th>判定条件</th>\n<th>行业默认动作</th>\n<th>电商站点的风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Valid</td>\n<td>命中一条 ROA 且 ASN、掩码都匹配</td>\n<td>接受，优先级正常</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Invalid</td>\n<td>有覆盖它的 ROA，但 ASN 错或掩码超长</td>\n<td><strong>丢弃</strong>（RFC 6811 建议，多数大网已执行）</td>\n<td>前缀直接不可达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NotFound</td>\n<td>没有任何 ROA 覆盖</td>\n<td>按本地策略接受（默认接受，部分网络降权）</td>\n<td>可被他人冒名宣告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表就是跨境电商最需要盯的一行：<strong>如果你的前缀被别的 AS 抢先签了 ROA，你合法的宣告会变成 Invalid 而被丢弃</strong>——这是近年新型的&quot;反向劫持&quot;手法，靠的正是 RPKI 本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"roa-字段陷阱与-irr-rpsl-的一致性要求\">ROA 字段陷阱与 IRR/RPSL 的一致性要求</h2><p>ROA 的三个字段里，<code>maxLength</code> 最容易配错、也最常导致线上故障。正确姿势是<strong>最小授权</strong>：只给实际要宣告的掩码长度签发。若你计划对外宣告 <code>198.51.100.0/24</code>，maxLength 就写 24；写 22 等于授权别人宣告该 /22 里的任意子段，攻击面无谓放大。RFC 9319 专门讨论了 maxLength 陷阱，指出它会把一次误配升级成可被利用的劫持窗口。第二类配错是<strong>多 origin</strong>：跨国电商常在同一前缀上用多个 AS（自有 ASN 加云厂商 BYOIP ASN）宣告，若只给一个 ASN 签 ROA，另一个 AS 的宣告就变 Invalid——正确做法是同一前缀签多条 ROA，每条对一个合法起源 AS，ROA 之间是逻辑&quot;或&quot;。第三类是 <strong>AS0 ROA</strong>：origin ASN 写 AS0 是一种&quot;否定声明&quot;，断言该前缀<strong>不应被任何 AS 起源</strong>（RFC 6483、RFC 8360）。典型用途是保护已下线业务的前缀，任何人的宣告立刻被判 Invalid 丢弃，这是<strong>前缀劫持最有效的主动防御</strong>——与其等被劫持后再争，不如先声明&quot;谁也别想宣告&quot;。</p>\n<p>ROA 签发到全网生效不是瞬时的：CA 发布 → RP 缓存器轮询（rsync/RRDP，数分钟到一小时）→ 路由器同步（RFC 8210）→ 各对等方 ROV 生效。因此<strong>大促前临时增删宣告必须留提前量</strong>，否则会出现&quot;我已宣告、对端还没更新到我的 ROA&quot;的 Valid/NotFound 抖动；撤下业务前缀时宁可留 ROA 一个月，也不要业务刚下线就撤。上线前必查项：用 RIPEstat、APNIC Labs 的 RPKI 测量页或 Cloudflare Radar 查自己前缀的校验状态与全网可见性；校验器侧主流实现有 Routinator、rpki-client、FORT、OctoRPKI，Cisco/Juniper/Arista/Nokia 均支持配置 ROV 策略。</p>\n<p>IRR 的价值不在密码学，而在<strong>策略表达力</strong>：一条 RPSL <code>route:</code> 对象除前缀和起源 AS，还能挂 <code>mnt-by</code>、<code>member-of</code>（属于哪个 as-set）、<code>import</code>/<code>export</code> 策略——这些 ROA 表达不了。对等方做前缀过滤时，典型做法是拉取你的 <code>as-set</code> 展开成完整前缀列表再配置入向 filter；工具链是 IRRd 加 <code>bgpq4</code> 展开。RADb 对任何人开放提交，其问题也很鲜明：<strong>无签名可冒名</strong>、<strong>陈旧对象堆积</strong>（并购转手后无人清理，混入过滤列表）。行业共识因此是 <strong>RPKI 优先、IRR 兜底</strong>——Invalid 直接丢弃，NotFound 时再回退 IRR 前缀列表过滤。</p>\n<p>对跨境业务的实际要求是：<strong>同一批前缀要在 RPKI（ROA）与 IRR（route/route6 对象）两处都注册，且内容一致</strong>。只做一处就会在对端某个环节被拦下——做了 ROA 没做 IRR，用 IRR 过滤的对等方会拒收；做了 IRR 没做 ROA，启用 ROV 的对等方匹配不到覆盖时按本地策略处理甚至丢弃。与本章 <a href=\"peering-transit-relationship-model\">对等/传输关系模型</a> 的接口很直接：对等方是否接受你的路由，现在取决于它 ROV 的结果，而不只是前缀列表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"泄露与劫持的机理与防护组合\">泄露与劫持的机理与防护组合</h2><p>两类事故要分开治理。**劫持（hijack）**是别人宣告了你的前缀（起源 AS 错误），RPKI 的 ROA 对症——给所有自有前缀签 ROA，任何错误起源都变 Invalid。**泄露（route leak）**是某 AS 把从一方学到的路由传给了不该传的第三方，违反&quot;谷底自由&quot;（valley-free）规则：典型场景是客户把从上游学到的全表泄露给另一个对等方，导致全网把本该走骨干的流量灌进一条小管道。RFC 7908 给出泄露分类（type 1–6），并指出泄露往往不是恶意而是策略配错。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  UP[上游 Tier1 骨干] --&gt;|全表| LE[策略配错的客户 AS]&#10;  LE --&gt;|&quot;泄露:全表传给对等方&quot;| P1[对等方 A]&#10;  P1 --&gt;|流量被牵引| VICTIM[受害者网络]&#10;  UP --&gt;|正常路径| VICTIM&#10;  AS0[AS0 ROA + ROA 收窄] -.-&gt;|防劫持| LE&#10;  RFC9234[RFC 9234 BGP Role] -.-&gt;|防泄露| LE&#10;  ASPA[ASPA 草案] -.-&gt;|防泄露·验路径| P1\">graph TD\n  UP[上游 Tier1 骨干] --&gt;|全表| LE[策略配错的客户 AS]\n  LE --&gt;|\"泄露:全表传给对等方\"| P1[对等方 A]\n  P1 --&gt;|流量被牵引| VICTIM[受害者网络]\n  UP --&gt;|正常路径| VICTIM\n  AS0[AS0 ROA + ROA 收窄] -.-&gt;|防劫持| LE\n  RFC9234[RFC 9234 BGP Role] -.-&gt;|防泄露| LE\n  ASPA[ASPA 草案] -.-&gt;|防泄露·验路径| P1</pre><p>泄露的防护是另一套组合拳：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>RFC 9234（BCP 234）的 BGP Role</strong>：在 OPEN 消息里协商双方角色（Provider / Customer / Peer / RS-Server / RS-Client），一旦角色与收到的路由方向不符就丢弃并记录。这把 valley-free 从&quot;口头约定&quot;变成&quot;协议内可检查&quot;，2022 年成为 BCP。2. <strong>ASPA（Autonomous System Provider Authorization）</strong>：用类似 ROA 的方式签名声明&quot;我的合法上游是谁&quot;，从而验证每跳上游关系。截至本文写作仍是 IETF SIDROPS 草案（draft-ietf-sidrops-aspa-verification），少数网络试验性部署——当&quot;未来增量&quot;而非当前依赖。</li>\n<li><strong>Peerlock / 前缀+AS_PATH 过滤</strong>：约束对等方只能宣告其自身及下游前缀，是配置层兜底。</li>\n<li><strong>出向过滤（RFC 8893）</strong>：边界路由上只把 Valid 的路由向对等方宣告——既降低自己成为泄露源的概率，也避免因宣告 Invalid 被对端静默丢弃（silent drop 最难排查）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>泄露的收益与损失都发生在互联关系层，<a href=\"peering-transit-relationship-model\">对等/传输关系模型</a> 说明的 valley-free 规则正是 RFC 9234 要机器化检查的对象；RPKI 与 IRR 则负责在<strong>前缀粒度</strong>上把这份契约钉死。链路最终效果取决于 AS_PATH 如何被选路算法使用，见 <a href=\"../bgp-topology-bestpath/as-topology-session-path-attributes\">AS 拓扑、会话建立与路径属性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商工程落地-合规清单与故障排查\">跨境电商工程落地：合规清单与故障排查</h2><p>对一家有自有 ASN、在多个区域宣告前缀的跨境电商，路由源认证不是&quot;安全团队的选修课&quot;，而是<strong>可达性合规</strong>——政企、金融采购招标已普遍要求供应商提供 MANRS 合规声明与 RPKI 覆盖率。MANRS（Mutually Agreed Norms for Routing Security，Internet Society 推动）的四项行动是业界通用验收语言：过滤、反欺骗（BCP 38）、协调、全球验证。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合规项</th>\n<th>技术动作</th>\n<th>验证来源</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ROA 签发</td>\n<td>每个对外前缀签 ROA，ASN 与 maxLength 精确匹配</td>\n<td>各 RIR 门户 / RIPEstat</td>\n<td>对端 ROV 丢弃，区域不可达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多起源覆盖</td>\n<td>同前缀按实际宣告 ASN 签多条 ROA</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>云 BYOIP 旁路宣告被判 Invalid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AS0 保护</td>\n<td>未使用与下线前缀签 AS0 ROA</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>前缀被冒名宣告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IRR 一致</td>\n<td>RPKI 与 IRR 对象内容一致、及时清理</td>\n<td>IRR Explorer / RADb</td>\n<td>用 IRR 过滤的对等方拒收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出向过滤</td>\n<td>出向只宣告 Valid 路由（RFC 8893）</td>\n<td>边界路由器策略核对</td>\n<td>成为泄露源，被对端惩罚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>角色协商</td>\n<td>启用 RFC 9234 BGP Role</td>\n<td>会话日志</td>\n<td>泄露无法被自动拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反欺骗</td>\n<td>源地址验证 BCP 38 / RFC 8704</td>\n<td>MANRS Observatory</td>\n<td>被列入黑名单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>排障&quot;某地区突然访问不了&quot;按此顺序定位，可覆盖绝大多数源认证类故障：<strong>先查前缀 RPKI 状态是否 Invalid</strong>（最常见：ROA 的 ASN 写错、maxLength 太窄、被他人抢先签 ROA），<strong>再查 IRR 对象</strong>是否过期或指向废弃 ASN，<strong>再查对端过滤</strong>（用 looking glass 看它眼中你的 AS_PATH），<strong>再回溯路由泄露</strong>（BGPStream / RIPE RIS / RouteViews 归档），<strong>最后查反欺骗与黑洞路由</strong>。</p>\n<p>一条纪律值得强调：<strong>ROA 与 IRR 变更要走和代码一样的发布流程</strong>——双人复核、变更后验证全网校验状态、保留回滚对象。一次手抖把 maxLength 从 /24 改成 /16，可能在几分钟内把整个区域的宣告推向 Invalid，而对端丢弃是静默的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>BGP 不校验起源，<strong>源认证是补上这个缺口的独立一层</strong>；RPKI 提供密码学证明（ROA），IRR 提供策略表达，两者互补不可互替。</li>\n<li>ROA 三要素是 ASN、前缀、maxLength；<strong>maxLength 收窄、多起源签多条、下线前缀签 AS0</strong> 是三条最容易踩坑又最容易配对的规则（RFC 9319、RFC 8360）。</li>\n<li>校验三态 <strong>Valid / Invalid / NotFound</strong>（RFC 6811）中 Invalid 默认被现代网络丢弃，这是&quot;前缀被反向劫持&quot;的风险来源。</li>\n<li>劫持靠 ROA + AS0 防，<strong>泄露</strong>靠 RFC 9234 BGP Role、Peerlock、出向过滤（RFC 8893）与未来的 ASPA 防——两类事故分开治理。</li>\n<li>对跨境业务，源认证已从安全选修变成<strong>可达性合规</strong>，MANRS 四项行动是通用验收语言；ROA/IRR 变更必须像代码发布一样受控、可回滚。</li>\n<li>排障顺序固定为：RPKI 状态 → IRR 对象 → 对端过滤 → 路由泄露回溯 → 反欺骗。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关章节：同章 <a href=\"peering-transit-relationship-model\">对等/传输关系与互联商业模型</a> 解释的 valley-free 契约，正是本节 RFC 9234 要机器化检查的对象；<a href=\"../bgp-topology-bestpath/as-topology-session-path-attributes\">AS 拓扑、会话建立与路径属性</a> 说明通过源认证的路由接下来如何被选路算法使用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RPKI/ROA、IRR 源认证与泄露劫持防护合规","id":"rpki-roa-irr-源认证与泄露劫持防护合规"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ROA 字段陷阱与 IRR/RPSL 的一致性要求","id":"roa-字段陷阱与-irr-rpsl-的一致性要求"},{"level":2,"text":"泄露与劫持的机理与防护组合","id":"泄露与劫持的机理与防护组合"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商工程落地：合规清单与故障排查","id":"跨境电商工程落地-合规清单与故障排查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"导入导出策略、community 标记与本地优先级工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/bgp-interdomain-routing-anycast-peering-edge-traffic-engineering/peering-transit-policy-rpki/import-export-policy-community-tagging"},"next":{"title":"Anycast 地址模型、catchment 与 ECMP 边缘分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/bgp-interdomain-routing-anycast-peering-edge-traffic-engineering/anycast-traffic-engineering/anycast-model-catchment-ecmp"}}